  41:../../CM7/Core/Src/wwdg.c ****   /* PCLK3 = 120 MHz, prescaler 128 -> 1 tick = 4096*128/120MHz = 4.369 ms.
  42:../../CM7/Core/Src/wwdg.c ****      Counter MUST be 0x41..0x7F: 0x40 underflows to 0x3F in ONE tick and resets at once.
